<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="about-intro">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">About the project</p>
    <h1 class="display-xl gap-top-md">A travel journal for Malawi, <em>written by everyone</em>.</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="about-intro__text">
    <p class="lede">Malawi Hidden Gems is a place for travellers and locals to record the spots that make Malawi unforgettable: a quiet cove on the lake, a waterfall on the plateau, the best chambo in town.</p>
    <p class="lede">Anyone can share a story. No account, no sign-up. Just the place, a photo and what made it special.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/posts/new" class="btn btn--primary">Share a gem <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a href="/posts" class="btn btn--ghost">Read the stories</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ol class="pillars">
  <li class="pillar">
    <span class="pillar__num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
    <h2 class="display-md">Human stories first.</h2>
    <p>Travel memories, local food, hiking routes and wildlife sightings, told by the people who were there rather than by an advertiser.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="pillar">
    <span class="pillar__num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
    <h2 class="display-md">Works on a weak signal.</h2>
    <p>Pages you have opened stay readable offline, and images are compressed before upload, so the site still works on the road in remote areas.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="pillar">
    <span class="pillar__num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
    <h2 class="display-md">Anonymous, but protected.</h2>
    <p>When you publish, a private key is saved in your browser. Only that browser can edit or delete your story, without you needing an account.</p>
  </li>
</ol>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
